          "contentHtml": "\n<div class=\"p-4 md:p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[4px_4px_0px_#151b20] space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b-2 border-[#151b20] pb-3 flex-wrap gap-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-[#c9f3f4] text-[#0e7490] font-mono font-bold text-xs border border-[#151b20] shadow-[1px_1px_0px_#151b20]\">LAB 1 ACTIVE</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-sm md:text-base font-black text-[#151b20]\">Event-Time Watermarking & Sliding Window Studio</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-[#475569]\">Definition 9.8.1 & 9.8.2 Live Visualizer</span>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-[#334155] leading-relaxed\">\n    Interact with the real-time simulation below. Observe how the dashed red watermark line $W(t)$ advances as new maximum event timestamps arrive, triggering window materialization and segregating stragglers.\n  </p>\n  <div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#fff0b9] border border-[#151b20] text-xs font-mono text-[#854d0e]\">\n    👇 The full interactive simulator is docked directly below this presentation frame.\n  </div>\n</div>\n"
