          "contentHtml": "\n<div class=\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[4px_4px_0px_#22bfd7] my-2\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b-2 border-[#151b20]/15 pb-2 mb-2.5 flex-wrap gap-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-[#c9f3f4] text-[#0e7490] font-mono font-black text-xs border border-[#151b20] shadow-[1px_1px_0px_#151b20] uppercase tracking-wider\">🔬 SIMULATOR 9.9A</span>\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-mono font-black text-[#151b20]\">Lakehouse Columnar Storage & Pruning Studio</span>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#0e7490] bg-[#fffaf0] px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-[#151b20]\">Interactive Controls Below ↓</span>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-[#334155] mb-3 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n    Simulate Parquet column projection and min/max zone-map pruning against naive row-oriented CSV/JSONL scans, and observe bit-packed dictionary compression scaling.\n  </p>\n  <div class=\"bg-[#f6f0dc] p-3 rounded-xl border-2 border-[#151b20] space-y-2 text-xs\">\n    <span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#0e7490] font-black uppercase tracking-wider block border-b border-[#151b20]/20 pb-1\">⚡ Recommended Studio Experiments:</span>\n    <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#334155]\">\n      <span class=\"text-[#0e7490] font-bold font-mono text-xs\">1.</span>\n      <span class=\"text-xs leading-relaxed\">Load <strong>ML Feature Slice</strong>: Observe how selecting 25/500 columns with 40% zone survival cuts I/O by 98% (20 MB vs 1,000 MB).</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#334155]\">\n      <span class=\"text-[#0e7490] font-bold font-mono text-xs\">2.</span>\n      <span class=\"text-xs leading-relaxed\">Switch to <strong>Naive Row Scan</strong>: Observe zero pruning (100% row scan), transferring the full 1,000 MB partition across the wire.</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#334155]\">\n      <span class=\"text-[#0e7490] font-bold font-mono text-xs\">3.</span>\n      <span class=\"text-xs leading-relaxed\">Test <strong>High-Selectivity Zone Filter</strong>: Tight Z-order ordering shrinks row-group survival to 10%, achieving 99.75% I/O reduction!</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n"
