          "contentHtml": "\n<div class=\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20] text-center space-y-2\">\n  <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-[#ffc83e] text-[#151b20] font-mono text-xs border-2 border-[#151b20] font-black uppercase\">\n    <span>🔬 Simulator 9.10 • Tab A Active</span>\n  </div>\n  <h3 class=\"font-black text-base text-[#151b20]\">\n    Interactive Lab 1: End-to-End Latency &amp; Bottleneck Studio\n  </h3>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-[#475569] max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed\">\n    Use the interactive controls below this slide to balance micro-batch windows against GPU tensor batch sizing.\n    Observe real-time SLA compliance ($T_{\\text{e2e}} \\le 200\\text{ ms}$) and identify throughput ceilings ($\\lambda^*$).\n  </p>\n</div>\n"
