          "contentHtml": "\n<div class=\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20] text-center space-y-2\">\n  <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-[#c9f3f4] text-[#0e7490] font-mono text-xs border-2 border-[#151b20] font-black uppercase\">\n    <span>🎯 Formative Assessment • Self-Assessment #1 Aligned</span>\n  </div>\n  <h3 class=\"font-black text-base text-[#151b20]\">\n    Active Checkpoint 1: Additive Latency &amp; Micro-Batch Optimization\n  </h3>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-[#475569] max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed\">\n    Dr. Nova and Kaito challenge you to verify end-to-end pipeline latency budgeting and optimal micro-batch derivation.\n  </p>\n</div>\n"
