          "contentHtml": "\n<div class=\"space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b-2 border-[#151b20]/15 flex-wrap gap-2\">\n    <div class=\"font-mono text-xs font-black uppercase text-[#0e7490] tracking-wider\">\n      CAPSTONE PLAYBOOK • THE 4 CARDINAL RULES OF ADVANCED DATA COLLECTION\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-mono font-bold bg-[#c9f3f4] text-[#0e7490] border-2 border-[#151b20]\">\n      TRACK 9 MASTERY\n    </span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[2px_2px_0px_#151b20] space-y-1\">\n      <div class=\"font-mono font-bold text-[#0e7490]\">Rule 1: Additive E2E Budgeting &amp; Optimal Micro-Batching</div>\n      <p class=\"text-[#475569] leading-relaxed\">\n        Budget each pipeline stage additively ($t_{\\text{ingest}} + t_{\\text{buf}} + t_{\\text{inf}} + t_{\\text{commit}} \\le \\text{SLA}$)\n        and tune accumulation windows to closed-form optimum $\\Delta t^* = \\sqrt{2 t_{\\text{overhead}} / (\\lambda c_{\\text{delay}})}$.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[2px_2px_0px_#151b20] space-y-1\">\n      <div class=\"font-mono font-bold text-[#854d0e]\">Rule 2: Dynamic Tensor Batching to Prevent Bottlenecks</div>\n      <p class=\"text-[#475569] leading-relaxed\">\n        Never invoke single-item GPU RPCs ($B=1$) under streaming firehoses. Group records dynamically ($B_{\\text{gpu}}=32\\text{–}128$)\n        to saturate Tensor Cores, unlocking $40\\times$ throughput scaling matching Kafka partition ceilings.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[2px_2px_0px_#151b20]\">\n      <div class=\"font-mono font-bold text-[#15803d]\">Rule 3: Enforce Pigeonhole Quorums &amp; Compaction</div>\n      <p class=\"text-[#475569] leading-relaxed\">\n        Strictly maintain $R + W > N$ to guarantee overlapping read-write sets, and bin-pack streaming micro-files into\n        $512\\text{ MB}$ segments to reduce master NameNode metadata heap footprint by $20{,}000\\times$.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[2px_2px_0px_#151b20]\">\n      <div class=\"font-mono font-bold text-[#b91c1c]\">Rule 4: Continuous $3\\sigma$ SPC Monitoring for OOV Drift</div>\n      <p class=\"text-[#475569] leading-relaxed\">\n        Guard against silent model accuracy rot by tracking unknown token rates against Shewhart control limits ($\\text{UCL} = \\mu_0 + 3\\sigma_0$),\n        triggering automated subword tokenizer expansion before accuracy degrades.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"p-3 bg-[#fffdf7] rounded-xl border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[2px_2px_0px_#151b20] text-[10px] font-mono text-[#475569] leading-relaxed\">\n    <div class=\"font-bold text-[#15803d] uppercase mb-1\">Peer-Reviewed Scholarly Foundations (8 References):</div>\n    • [Wang2015] VLDB • [Carbone2017] VLDB • [Armbrust2020] VLDB • [Shvachko2010] MSST • [Zaharia2016] CACM • [Barroso2013] Datacenter • [Crankshaw2017] NSDI • [Sculley2015] NeurIPS\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-2 flex justify-center\">\n    <a href=\"../../track10-synthetic-data/\" class=\"px-6 py-2.5 rounded-xl border-2 border-[#151b20] bg-[#ffc83e] font-mono font-black text-xs text-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20] hover:bg-[#e6b437] transition-all\">\n      Next Track: Track 10 Synthetic Data &rarr;\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n"
